{"title":"2023 Halloween Event","slug":"2023_Halloween_Event","hero":{"file":"Grave.webp","width":381,"height":408},"pageid":1887,"revid":21062,"timestamp":"2026-02-03T06:10:25Z","lastEditor":"The1doctor1701","categories":["Events"],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"ghoulish-goods","text":"Ghoulish Goods"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ghoulish_Goods/\">Ghoulish Goods</a></b> is a store that was added during the Halloween 2023 update. It sells various exclusive Halloween items, which include gifts, decorations and <a href=\"__BASE__/category/Vinyls/\">Vinyls</a>. It is owned and run by the Headless Horseman. \n</p>\n<h2 id=\"ghoulish-goods\">Ghoulish Goods</h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store. \n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tombstone/\">Tombstone</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Grave\">Grave</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Grave.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></td>\n<td>575 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Halloween_Balloons/\">Halloween Balloons</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Hwballons\">Hwballons</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Hwballons.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></td>\n<td>450 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Cauldron/\">Cauldron</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archiv