d>\n<td>2,499 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Membri/\">Gift of Membri</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gift of Membri\">Gift of Membri</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gift of Membri\">Gift of Membri</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Gift_of_Membri.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></td>\n<td>4,199 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fallen_Fortress/\">Fallen Fortress</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Fortress\">Fortress</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Fortress\">Fortress</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Fortress.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></td>\n<td>3,666 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hallow_Woods/\">Hallow Woods</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Hallowwood\">Hallowwood</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Hallowwood\">Hallowwood</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Hallowwood.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></td>\n<td>6,660 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy/\">Candy</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>The eye at the top of the shop always stares at the players camera position.</li>\n<li>The buyable <a href=\"__BASE__/category/Vinyls/\">Vinyls</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fallen_Fortress/\">Fallen Fortress</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hallow_Woods/\">Hallow Woods</a>, will apply a fog effect on anybody who is on the plot while the Vinyl is playing.</li>\n<li>When the shop is approached fog will appear and the <a href=\"__BASE__/category/Vinyls/\">Vinyl</a> <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fallen_Fortress/\">Fallen Fortress</a> will start playing.</li>\n<li>The Fireflies was changed to ghost for the event.</li></ul>"}
